<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Project Sdk="Dalamud.NET.Sdk/15.0.0">
  <PropertyGroup>
    <Version>0.3.1.0</Version>
    <Author>ahadev</Author>
    <Name>BladUI</Name>
    <Punchline>Baldur's Gate-style inventory: multiselect, bulk move, one-click armoury cleanup.</Punchline>
    <Description>Your inventory, your way — a Baldur's Gate-style inventory window for FFXIV.

• Multiselect: click, Ctrl+Click, Shift+Click ranges, Ctrl+A — then move everything in one click.
• Your own layout: drag-arranged custom order that ignores the game's slot shuffle, plus sort by type, name, item level, rarity, and more, with search and category filters.
• Rarity-colored tiles, rich tooltips, gearset badges, HQ marks.
• Ctrl+Click instant move to the open retainer or saddlebag; send gear to its correct armoury slot.
• Wares: mark your to-sell pile (with live market-vs-vendor comparison via universalis.app).
• Utilities: reviewable bulk actions — clean out your armoury chest, auto-mark vendor trash — every step previewed before it runs.
• Use items and assign hotbar slots from the window.

Every action maps to a normal player click, validated by the game — BladUI saves clicks, never automates.</Description>
    <Tags>inventory;bag;armoury;armory;saddlebag;retainer;sort;search;sell;wares;multiselect;move;gearset;quality-of-life;qol;ui</Tags>
    <RepoUrl>https://github.com/AHAKuo/FFXIVBladUI</RepoUrl>
  </PropertyGroup>
  <PropertyGroup>
    <AllowUnsafeBlocks>true</AllowUnsafeBlocks>
  </PropertyGroup>
</Project>
